<title>SPAIN: Spain to be in EMU from day one - Bank Spain's Rojo.</title>
<headline>Spain to be in EMU from day one - Bank Spain's Rojo.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Spain governor Luis Angel Rojo said on Friday he sees Spain joining European economic and monetary union (EMU) &quot;on the first day&quot;.</p>
<p>Rojo, at a seminar in Madrid on EMU, also said that the EU Commission's 1997-98 forecasts on Spain's deficit to GDP are &quot;completely reasonable&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The perspective that the EU Commission has drawn seems to be completely reasonable to me,&quot; Rojo said.</p>
</text>
